OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 2 MAY
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GBefore the world gets loud, find
OL,6,     Gyour sanctuary here. AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,7,     Gbrings a chilled-out energy to
OL,8,     Gyour weekend, soundtracking those
OL,9,     Gquiet, early hours with pure
OL,10,     Gmusical elegance.
OL,11,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,12,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,13,     Gof great music and Radiohead's
OL,14,     GJonny Greenwood shares his
OL,15,     G'First, Last and Everything' and
OL,16,     Gchats about his latest music
OL,17,     Gproject.
OL,18,G1000FThe Beth Ditto Show
OL,19,     GBeth returns for Saturday with
OL,20,     Gmusic from Lion, Frank Ocean, The
OL,21,     GFlying Lizards, Electrelane,
OL,22,     GD'Angelo and much more!
